{"id":99,"doub_id":99,"title":"哈布洛先生 Mr. Hublot","years":"2013","class":"动画,奇幻","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2870721722.webp","doub_score":7.7,"IMDB_number":"tt3043542","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"洛朗·维茨","bianji":"[\"洛朗·维茨\",\"亚历山大·埃斯皮加雷斯\",\"洛朗·维茨\"]","performer":"","language":"无对白","release":"2013-10-15(华沙电影节)、2014-02-26(法国)","alias":"","abstract":"这是一栋弥漫着漫长历史气息的老房子，墙上挂满了照片，屋顶上的灯接触不良，几经开关才能点亮。房主人哈布洛先生头戴精密仪器，他推开阳台的门，眼前竟然呈现一个被硕大笨重却精密、带着极强蒸汽朋克气息的机械世界。甚至连窗台上的花和路边的狗也都是工业化的产物。哈洛夫先生固守自己的房屋，工作和生活全都在斗室内完成。可是他平静枯燥的生活被那条机器狗打乱了，小狗蜷缩在街角，怯懦而无助。接连两天，哈洛夫都被小狗的声音所牵制。眼看狗狗即将被垃圾车毁灭，这位害怕踏出房门的先生决定鼓起勇气冲出去……\n　　本片荣获2013年3D艺术节S3D/Seine-Saint-Denis最高奖和最佳动画短片奖。 ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2169937531.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2169937484.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2169933901.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2169933893.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2169933882.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2870721722.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2161287578.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1mEiZ_3z9Zv0P6JyByvnuJQ?pwd=q82b\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":0}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 卢森堡 / 法国","orginName":"哈布洛先生 Mr. Hublot","ratingbetterthan":"好于 85% 短片\n","tag":"第86届奥斯卡金像奖获奖名单"}